<title>USA: ADVO names Gary Mulloy president, COO.</title>
<headline>ADVO names Gary Mulloy president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>WINDSOR, Conn. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>ADVO Inc said on Monday that Gary Mulloy will be president and chief operating officer, effective November 4, 1996.</p>
<p>Mulloy will also be elected to ADVO's board of directors at their next meeting, the company said. Mulloy has served since 1990 as president and chief executive officer of Pilkington Barnes-Hind Inc, ADVO said.</p>
</text>
